This model version is Tag 1, revision 1772, as described in 

Thum, T., Caldararu, S., Engel. J., Kern, M., Pallandt, M., Schnur, R., 
     Yu, L., and Zaehle, S. A new terrestrial biosphere model with coupled 
     carbon, nitrogen, and phosphorus cycles (QUINCY v1.0; revision 1772), in prep. 

